        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>On Scotland's North East coast, forest envelops a castle and meets the sea. From aromatic leaves and roots gathered where the two meet, we shaped our gin to evoke the experience of forest and garden.</p>"
