      "blocks": {
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Here, in the north, seasons are strong. In summer, when the sun only briefly dips below the horizon, long days lead plants to surge with vitality and we replenish our botanical supplies. Through winter we continue making gin, while celebrating the season's snow, ice, and Northern Lights.</p>"
          }
